<rml>
<head>
	<title>E-mail (Phase 6 wireframe)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="laptop.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- M2 wireframe of the native laptop (docs/ui/laptop.md). Literal data.
     Generated by tools/ui/phase6_mocks.py: edit the generator, not this file. -->
<body class="lt">
<div class="lt-root">
	<div class="lt-bg"></div>
	<div class="lt-top">
		<div class="lt-os" title="sir-FER 4.0"><img class="icon" src="icon-laptop"/></div>
		<div class="lt-app"><span class="t" id="laptop.title">E-mail</span><span class="s">3 unread</span></div>
		<div class="lt-stat" id="laptop.date"><span class="k">Day 12</span><span class="v">14:35</span></div>
		<div class="lt-stat" id="laptop.balance"><span class="k">Balance</span><span class="v">$48,250</span></div>
		<div class="lt-stat" id="laptop.team"><span class="k">Team</span><span class="v">9</span></div>
		<button class="icon-btn first-btn" id="laptop.help" title="Help (H)"><img class="icon" src="icon-question"/></button>
		<button class="btn" id="laptop.tomap"><img class="icon" src="icon-map"/><span class="label">Map</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="lt-dock" id="laptop.dock"><div class="app active" id="laptop.app.email" title="E-mail (F1)"><img class="icon" src="icon-mail"/><span class="label">E-mail</span><span class="kbd">F1</span><span class="badge info">3</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.web" title="Web (F2)"><img class="icon" src="icon-globe"/><span class="label">Web</span><span class="kbd">F2</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.finances" title="Finances (F3)"><img class="icon" src="icon-money"/><span class="label">Finances</span><span class="kbd">F3</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.personnel" title="Personnel (F4)"><img class="icon" src="icon-squad"/><span class="label">Personnel</span><span class="kbd">F4</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.history" title="History (F5)"><img class="icon" src="icon-history"/><span class="label">History</span><span class="kbd">F5</span></div><div class="app" id="laptop.app.files" title="Files (F6)"><img class="icon" src="icon-folder"/><span class="label">Files</span><span class="kbd">F6</span><span class="badge info">1</span></div><div class="app off" id="laptop.close" title="Close the laptop and go back to the map (Esc)"><img class="icon" src="icon-power"/><span class="label">Close</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></div></div>
	<div class="lt-win" id="laptop.window">
		<div class="lt-pad" style="padding: 0;"><div class="ml"><div class="ml-list">
			<div class="ml-tools"><span class="strong">Inbox</span><span class="count">11 messages · 3 unread</span><span class="grow"></span>
				<button class="btn btn-ghost" id="email.delete"><img class="icon" src="icon-remove"/><span class="label">Delete</span><span class="kbd">Del</span></button></div>
			<div class="thead"><span class="th m-dot"></span><span class="th m-from" id="email.sort.from"><span>From</span></span><span class="th m-subj" id="email.sort.subject"><span>Subject</span></span><span class="th m-day sorted" id="email.sort.day"><span>Day</span><img class="icon" src="icon-sort-desc"/></span></div>
			<div class="scroll" id="email.list"><div class="tr unread selected" id="email.mail[0]"><div class="m-dot"><img class="icon" src="icon-ok"/></div><span class="m-from">Enrico Chivaldori</span><span class="m-subj">Re: Drassen — keep the pressure on</span><span class="m-day">12</span></div><div class="tr unread" id="email.mail[1]"><div class="m-dot"><img class="icon" src="icon-ok"/></div><span class="m-from">Bobby Ray’s</span><span class="m-subj">Your order has shipped</span><span class="m-day">12</span></div><div class="tr unread" id="email.mail[2]"><div class="m-dot"><img class="icon" src="icon-ok"/></div><span class="m-from">A.I.M.</span><span class="m-subj">Steroid — contract ending</span><span class="m-day">12</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[3]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">M.I.S. Insurance</span><span class="m-subj">Policy confirmation: Ivan, Lynx</span><span class="m-day">11</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[4]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">Enrico Chivaldori</span><span class="m-subj">Drassen airport</span><span class="m-day">10</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[5]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">I.M.P.</span><span class="m-subj">Your profile results</span><span class="m-day">3</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[6]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">Speck T. Kline</span><span class="m-subj">M.E.R.C. is open for business!</span><span class="m-day">2</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[7]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">Bobby Ray’s</span><span class="m-subj">Now open: Bobby Ray’s Guns ’n Things</span><span class="m-day">2</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[8]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">A.I.M.</span><span class="m-subj">Hiring confirmation: Ivan Dolvich</span><span class="m-day">1</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[9]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">Enrico Chivaldori</span><span class="m-subj">Inquiry</span><span class="m-day">1</span></div><div class="tr read" id="email.mail[10]"><div class="m-dot"></div><span class="m-from">McGillicutty’s Mortuary</span><span class="m-subj">We are here for you</span><span class="m-day">1</span></div></div>
		</div>
		<div class="ml-read" id="email.reader">
			<div class="ml-rhead"><span class="ml-subject" id="email.subject">Re: Drassen — keep the pressure on</span>
				<div class="ml-meta"><span class="from">Enrico Chivaldori</span><span>Day 12, 14:02</span><span class="grow"></span><div class="pager" id="email.pages"><button class="icon-btn" title="Previous page"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-left"/></button><span>Page 1 / 1</span><button class="icon-btn" title="Next page"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-right"/></button></div></div></div>
			<div class="ml-body"><p>Good work at the airport. The whole of Drassen is talking about it, and so is Deidranna — expect her to send troops north before the week is out.</p><p>The townspeople will only stand with us if they believe we can protect them. Train the militia, hold the town, and the mine’s income will start coming your way.</p><p>I am sending the next payment now. Use it well.</p><p>Enrico</p>
				<div class="ml-attach"><img class="icon" src="icon-money"/><div class="grow"><span class="strong">Payment received: $20,000</span><span class="dim">Added to your balance (Finances)</span></div><button class="btn btn-ghost"><img class="icon" src="icon-chart"/><span class="label">Finances</span></button></div>
			</div>
			<div class="ml-ract"><button class="btn btn-danger" id="email.read.delete"><img class="icon" src="icon-remove"/><span class="label">Delete</span><span class="kbd">Del</span></button><span class="grow"></span><button class="btn" id="email.prev"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-up"/><span class="label">Previous</span><span class="kbd">Up</span></button><button class="btn" id="email.next"><img class="icon" src="icon-chevron-down"/><span class="label">Next</span><span class="kbd">Down</span></button><button class="btn" id="email.close"><img class="icon" src="icon-close"/><span class="label">Close</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></button></div>
		</div></div></div>
		
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
